<title>UK: Hamburg Hypo sets 200 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburg Hypo sets 200 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN HAMBURG AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.75     MATURITY   *18.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAMBURG   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO APRIL 1997, THEN 4.25 PCT IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBREIF 968</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
